  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div class=\"mb-1 mt-2 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed first:mt-0\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-line;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-family:BacktickFix, 'local_font', 'local_font Fallback', sans-serif;margin-top:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;line-height:1.625;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:600;font-family:BacktickFix, sans-serif;\">About Our Brand &amp; Products:</strong> Muscle MX is a premium CBD wellness brand founded in 2016, specializing in topical pain relief and recovery. Our core products—Activate, Recovery, and Restore—feature a patented heating/cooling balm system with nano-silver and hyaluronic acid for fast-acting relief.</div><div class=\"mb-1 mt-2 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed first:mt-0\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-line;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-family:BacktickFix, 'local_font', 'local_font Fallback', sans-serif;margin-bottom:0.25rem;margin-top:0.5rem;line-height:1.625;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:600;font-family:BacktickFix, sans-serif;\">What Makes Us Different:</strong> We're GMP-manufactured in the USA, third-party lab tested, and THC-free (passes drug tests). With 5,000+ five-star reviews and features in Forbes, Men's Health, PopSugar, and Newsweek, we've built trust through transparency and results.</div><div class=\"mb-1 mt-2 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed first:mt-0\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-line;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-family:BacktickFix, 'local_font', 'local_font Fallback', sans-serif;margin-bottom:0.25rem;margin-top:0.5rem;line-height:1.625;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:600;font-family:BacktickFix, sans-serif;\">How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong> Earn competitive commissions on every sale driven through your unique affiliate link. Plus, access exclusive promotional materials, discount codes, and performance bonuses.</div><div class=\"mb-1 mt-2 whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed first:mt-0\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-line;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-family:BacktickFix, 'local_font', 'local_font Fallback', sans-serif;margin-bottom:0.25rem;margin-top:0.5rem;line-height:1.625;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(229,231,235);font-weight:600;font-family:BacktickFix, sans-serif;\">How to Promote Us:</strong> Share our products with your audience through social media, email, blogs, or your platform. We provide ready-made graphics, product links, and talking points to make promotion effortless.</div></div></div>",
